[{"id": 142490399, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 142485233, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>The Activity:</h2>\n<p>Look at the list of these prime numbers above.</p>\n<p>Decide if these statements are <strong>sometimes </strong>true, <strong>always </strong>true or <strong>never </strong>true.</p>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prime numbers are odd numbers</li>\n<li>Prime numbers are multiples of 10.</li>\n<li>Numbers which end in 7 are prime.</li>\n<li>Prime numbers above 3 are next door to a multiple of 6.</li>\n<li>2 is the only even prime number.</li>\n<li>There is a gap of 4 between each prime number.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 142490555, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 142485233, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\">Fun Fact</span>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">There are different species of an insect called the Periodic Cicada. Some emerge from the ground at 13-year intervals and some at 17-year intervals – never at 12, 14 or 16 year intervals.  These cicadas have evolved a lifecycle based on prime numbers because this means they coincide with predators’ life cycles less frequently and so they have been more successful. </span></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 142496783, "text": "Solutions", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 142491808, "text": null, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 246, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><strong>Prime numbers are odd numbers</strong></p>\n<p>Sometimes true - 2 is a prime number and it is even.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Prime numbers are multiples of 10</strong></p>\n<p>Never true - Multiples of 10 are even and have lots of factors.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Numbers which end in 7 are prime numbers</strong></p>\n<p>Sometimes true - 17,37,47 and 97 are prime, but 27,77 and 87 are not.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Prime</strong> <strong>numbers are next door to a multiple of 6.</strong></p>\n<p>Always true - prime numbers are always one more or one less than a multiple of 6.  Not every multiple of 6 has a prime number next to it though.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>2 is the only even prime number</strong></p>\n<p>Always true. All the other prime numbers are odd.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>There is a gap of 4 between each prime number.</strong></p>\n<p>Sometimes true. There is a gap of 4 between 7 and 11 and between 13 and 17 but there is a gap of 2 between 11 and 13.</p>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 246, "name": "Prime number solutions", "logCreatedAt": "2023-09-18T11:21:18.863682", "logUpdatedAt": "2023-09-18T11:21:18.863682", "logCreatedById": 108180408, "logUpdatedById": 108180408, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 3, "btnType": "SECONDARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 142485233, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 246, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 142490425, "text": "A cicada on a branch", "modal": {"steps